{
  "id": "ssh.passwordless.enable",
  "version": 1,
  "side": "controller",
  "title": { "zh": "配置 SSH 免密登录", "en": "Enable SSH passwordless login" },
  "summary": "生成专用密钥、幂等写入 authorized_keys，验证通过后才切断旧连接并切换认证方式",
  "risk": "R3",
  "params": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "keyType": { "type": "string", "enum": ["ed25519", "rsa"], "default": "ed25519" },
      "keepPasswordAuth": { "type": "boolean", "default": true, "description": "是否保留服务端密码认证（建议保留以便救援）" }
    },
    "additionalProperties": false
  },
  "requires": { "root": false, "distros": [], "binaries": [] },
  "idempotent": true,
  "timeoutMs": 60000,
  "check": { "probe": "ssh.pubkeyState" },
  "apply": {
    "default": { "handler": "auth.enablePasswordless" }
  },
  "verify": { "probe": "ssh.pubkeyState", "expect": { "serviceKeyInstalled": true } },
  "rollback": { "strategy": "restore-authorized-keys-backup" },
  "notes": [
    "本动作由主控端本地执行（side=controller），**不产生任何远端 argv** —— 它操作的就是连接本身",
    "事务顺序：写 key → **另开连接验证成功** → 才切断旧连接；验证失败则回滚并保留旧连接",
    "核心不变式：任何时刻至少存在一条可用连接路径（绝不锁死虚拟机）",
    "参数尚未接线：传非默认值会被 fail-closed 阻断"
  ]
}
